## Decisions

<!--
  Documentation only (KLC-116, F-005): this block is NOT rendered by the
  `options` loop above — the design agent writes `[!DECISION]` items here by
  hand, after picking. Shown so a reader of this template sees the expected
  shape, including the `evidence=` attribute every decision carries:

  > [!DECISION D-001] owner=agent date=<ISO> evidence=observed|read|assumed
  > <what was decided, and why>

  `observed` needs the command and its output in a fenced block next to the
  item; `read` needs `src=<file>:<line>` that resolves; `assumed` needs a
  non-empty `if-false=`. An item written before this attribute existed
  carries no `evidence=` at all — that predates the rule and is never
  retroactively enforced.
-->

